      "content": "i know... i know there's help in the world, but not here. not in this city. there's no medicine or doctors coming through those gates. just the hunger and the steel. i look at my hands and i don't even recognize them anymore. i just want to die with some shred of what i used to be, instead of waiting for them to find me like an animal in the dirt. do you think there's any dignity left for us?",
